<title>USA: MiniMed in pact with Trimeris.</title>
<headline>MiniMed in pact with Trimeris.</headline>
<dateline>SYLMAR, Calif. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>MiniMed Inc said Tuesday it had entered into a strategic alliance with privately owned Trimeris Inc to collaborate on the development of therapies for various medical conditions.</p>
<p>The collaboration will take advantage of the infusion delivery systems of MiniMed and the antiviral compounds being developed by Trimeris, they said.</p>
